// Extracted from pak1.pk3 and patched for coop [user 2026-08-02] bug-1294.
// ONLY CHANGE: the bare `level waittill spawn` on line 2 became the coop shim.
// In coop this file is exec'd from e2l1.scr::InitLights AFTER the spawn event has already
// fired, and `level waittill spawn` on an event that has passed is a hard Script Error -
// which ABORTS THE THREAD, so every line below it never ran: the five setlightstyle calls
// (alarm / flicker x3 / broken light) and all the $jeepfire* effect threads. That is the
// reported 'fog should be thicker, effects leave room to be desired' on this map.
// replace.scr::waitTillSpawn returns immediately when spawn has already happened.


waitthread coop_mod/replace.scr::waitTillSpawn

level.lightStyleNo = 0

//
// setup light styles
//
//[user 2026-08-03] bug-1331 - style 1 is the red ALARM pulse, and the railway bridge
//lightmap is baked against style 1: the whole bridge rail pulsed red ("like an objective").
//Retail has the same defect, but nobody ever saw it in coop because this script never ran
//until bug-1294 - the user reported it within a day of that fix. Constant-white ramp =
//static lighting, exactly the pre-bug-1294 look for style-1 surfaces.
setlightstyle 1 "textures/coop_static_map.tga"
//[user 2026-08-04] bug-1331 BISECT ROUND 2 - the rails still blink with style 1 static AND
//r_dynamiclight 0 (live test), so the blinker is one of the remaining BAKED styles below.
//All four flattened to constant mid-gray: if the rails go static, the culprit is in 2-5 and
//we restore flicker for the styles the campfires/broken lights actually use, one by one.
//[user 2026-08-04] bug-1331 BISECT RESULT: rails STILL blink with styles 1-5 ALL constant
//AND r_dynamiclight 0 - the map lightstyles are exonerated; suspicion moves to the gl2
//renderer (styled/entity lighting path). Retail flicker ramps restored; style 1 kept static
//pending the gl1-vs-gl2 bisect (the alarm ramp analysis still stands on its own merits).
setlightstyle 2 "textures/flicker_map.tga"
setlightstyle 3 "textures/flicker_map02.tga"
setlightstyle 4 "textures/flicker_map03.tga"
setlightstyle 5 "textures/brokenLight_map.tga"


//
// setup effects
//
$jeepfire1 thread start 2 150 10
$jeepfire2 thread start 4 150 10
//$jeepfire3 thread start 2 150 10
$jeepfire3_2 thread start 2 250 10
$jeepfire3_3 thread start 4 250 10
$planefire1 thread start 2 450 10
$planefire2 thread start 4 450 10
$campfire1 thread start 2 100 10
//$campfire1_2 thread start 2 140 5
//$campfire1_3 thread start 2 150 5
//$campfire2 thread start 2 160 10
$campfire2_2 thread start 4 100 5
$campfire2_3 thread start 2 150 5
//$campfire3 thread start 4 150 10  
$campfire3_2 thread start 4 120 10
$campfire3_3 thread start 4 120 10                              

 

end


start local.lightStyle local.rad local.int:

	self rendereffects "+lightstyledynamiclight"
	self lightstyle local.lightStyle

	while (1)
	{
		local.radius=local.rad + randomint local.int
		self lightRadius local.radius
		wait .1
	}
end
